ster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790600/extras/7461ec0591917eac6da99fbc7a186369.poster.avif?t=1785726916\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790600/extras/7461ec0591917eac6da99fbc7a186369.webm?t=1785726916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790600/extras/7461ec0591917eac6da99fbc7a186369.mp4?t=1785726916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>DRAGON BALL: Sparking! ZERO takes the legendary gameplay of the Budokai Tenkaichi series and raises it to whole new levels. Become a super warrior and experience the earth-shaking, limit-breaking power of Dragon Ball battles!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790600/extras/9cefb3be9f93b7cc696a90c04c2e6359.poster.avif?t=1785726916\" width=380 height=69 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790600/extras/9cefb3be9f93b7cc696a90c04c2e6359.webm?t=1785726916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash the strength of over 180 fighters from Dragon Ball Z, Dragon Ball Super, Dragon Ball GT, and selected Dragon Ball movies, all in the base game! Each character comes with their own signature abilities, transformations, and techniques.<br><br>Make the destructive power of the strongest fighters ever to appear in Dragon Ball yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790600/extras/be3ce7d4941a256f90f44e2971cae6a6.poster.avif?t=1785726916\" width=427 height=69 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790600/extras/be3ce7d4941a256f90f44